{\"entity_type\": \"table\", \"id\": \"FCLT_ROOMS\", \"name\": \"FCLT_ROOMS\"}, {\"entity_type\": \"table\", \"id\": \"MASTER_DEPT_HIERARCHY\", \"name\": \"MASTER_DEPT_HIERARCHY\"}]}}"
