      "content": "The database is inaccessible (authentication error), so I'll base the final SQL on the strong semantic-network evidence, particularly the exact precedent metric `dw_1465` whose sub-query matches this task's wording verbatim.\n\n---\n\n## Report\n\n### 1. Entity Semantics\n\n**Tables (Phase 1 survivors, all investigated):**\n- **FCLT_ROOMS** — Facilities room inventory; one row per physical room. Key columns: `FCLT_ROOM_KEY` (surrogate key), `FCLT_ORGANIZATION_KEY` (organization assignment), `ORGANIZATION_NAME`, `AREA` (\"Room area in square meters; used in area statistics (average, range, variance)\").\n- **FCLT_ORGANIZATION** — Facilities organization dimension; one row per organization in the hierarchy tree (levels 1–6). Key columns: `FCLT_ORGANIZATION_KEY`, `ORGANIZATION_NAME` (\"Display name of the organization... used for organization-name reporting\"), `ORGANIZATION_LEVEL`, `DLC_KEY`, `ASSIGNABLE`.\n- **FAC_ROOMS** — Same room structure as FCLT_ROOMS but FAC_* family keys (`FAC_ROOM_KEY`, `ORGANIZATION_KEY`, `AREA` in square meters).\n- **FAC_ORGANIZATION** — Same organization structure but keyed by `ORGANIZATION_KEY`, carries `D_CODE` instead of DLC_KEY/DLC_NAME; fewer organizations (169 vs 180).\n- **SPACE_DETAIL** — Space-assignment fact; rooms assigned to space units with `ROOM_SQUARE_FOOTAGE` (square feet), joins via `SPACE_UNIT_KEY` — no direct organization key.\n- **SPACE_UNIT / SPACE_UNIT2** — Space unit dimensions bridging SPACE_DETAIL to FCLT_ORGANIZATION via `FCLT_ORGANIZATION_KEY` (SPACE_UNIT2 lacks the org attribution).\n- **ZPM_ROOMS_LOAD** — Space-planning room feed; **carries no area column** (per its desc: \"without the area and use-key columns carried by FCLT_ROOMS\").\n- **FCLT_ROOMS_HIST** — Historical rooms per fiscal period (only 201505 covered).\n- Supporting/lookup tables found but not measure-bearing for this task: FCLT_BUILDING, FCLT_FLOOR, SPACE_FLOOR, SPACE_USAGE, BUILDINGS, FCLT_MAJOR_USE, FAC_MAJOR_USE, FAC_BUILDING, FAC_FLOOR, FCLT_ORG_DLC_KEY, HR_ORG_UNIT, HR_ORG_UNIT_NEW, MASTER_DEPT_HIERARCHY, MASTER_DEPT_HIERARCHY_LINKS, SPACE_SUPERVISOR_USAGE, FCLT_BUILDING_HIST, FCLT_FLOOR_HIST, SIS_DEPARTMENT, SIS_ADMIN_DEPARTMENT, and other non-facilities tables (SUBJECT_*, STUDENT_*, LIBRARY_*, SE_PERSON, etc.) returned by the broad search — the latter group is unrelated to room area/organization and was screened out as irrelevant to the measure required.\n\n**Metrics (precedents):**\n- **dw_1465** — Contains a CTE with *exactly* this task's wording: \"standard deviation... of the area of rooms assigned to the organization (considering only organizations with more than 5 rooms and excluding organizations named 'ADMISSIONS')\". Its SQL:\n  ```sql\n  SELECT fo.ORGANIZATION_NAME, STDDEV(fr.AREA) AS area_stddev, fo.FCLT_ORGANIZATION_KEY\n  FROM FCLT_ROOMS fr\n  JOIN FCLT_ORGANIZATION fo ON fr.FCLT_ORGANIZATION_KEY = fo.FCLT_ORGANIZATION_KEY\n  WHERE fo.ORGANIZATION_NAME <> 'ADMISSIONS'\n  GROUP BY fo.ORGANIZATION_NAME, fo.FCLT_ORGANIZATION_KEY\n  HAVING COUNT(fr.FCLT_ROOM_KEY) > 5\n  ```\n- **dw_1833** — Same-shape precedent: `STDDEV(r.AREA)` over FCLT_ROOMS ⋈ FCLT_ORGANIZATION, `HAVING COUNT(*) > 5`, `ORGANIZATION_NAME NOT IN ('ADMISSIONS')` (plus DLC-key filter specific to that question).\n\n**Concepts:** `concept_room_space_inventory`, `concept_facility_organization_dimension` (details retrieved); others (`concept_space_unit_dimension`, `concept_building_inventory`, `concept_floor_inventory`, `concept_dept_hr_org_hierarchy`, etc.) are context for the domain but carry no room-area-per-organization measure.\n\n**Column concepts:** `column_concept_facility_organization_key` (retrieved in full), `column_concept_assignable_area`, `column_concept_building_room`, `column_concept_access_level`, `column_concept_dlc_key`, `column_concept_num_of_rooms` — relevant for join-key and measure disambiguation.\n\n### 2. Lineage & Relationships\n- **dw_1465 lineage** (traced): children = FCLT_ORGANIZ