ne | requires SPACE_UNIT bridge | n/a |\n\n**3b. Task-Requirement Fitness:**\n- Required measure: room `AREA` → FCLT_ROOMS **SUPPORTED**; FAC_ROOMS **SUPPORTED**; SPACE_DETAIL **SUPPORTED but different unit (sq ft)**; ZPM_ROOMS_LOAD **NOT-SUPPORTED** (no area column).\n- Required grouping key: organization → FCLT_ROOMS+FCLT_ORGANIZATION **SUPPORTED** (direct FK); SPACE_DETAIL **SUPPORTED only via bridge**.\n- Required filter: `ORGANIZATION_NAME <> 'ADMISSIONS'` → **SUPPORTED** on FCLT_ORGANIZATION.ORGANIZATION_NAME; precedent dw_1465 uses exactly this.\n- Required HAVING: room count > 5 → **SUPPORTED** via `COUNT(fr.FCLT_ROOM_KEY) > 5` (precedent) or `COUNT(*) > 5` (dw_1833).\n\n**3c. Wording-to-Field Anchoring:** \"area of rooms assigned to it\" lexically matches FCLT_ROOMS.AREA (\"Room area in square meters; used in area statistics\") with FCLT_ROOMS.FCLT_ORGANIZATION_KEY documented as the organization assignment/occupancy key. \"Organization name\" matches FCLT_ORGANIZATION.ORGANIZATION_NAME (\"used for organization-name reporting\"). The phrase \"excluding organizations named 'ADMISSIONS'\" matches the precedent's `fo.ORGANIZATION_NAME <> 'ADMISSIONS'` filter on FCLT_ORGANIZATION. FAC_ROOMS would map equally by column names, but the discriminating facts (metric precedents, broader org coverage of FCLT_ORGANIZATION) point to the FCLT_* family.\n\n**3d. Precedent Usage Evidence:** STDDEV-of-room-AREA-per-organization precedents: **2** — dw_1465 (FCLT_ROOMS ⋈ FCLT_ORGANIZATION, GROUP BY ORGANIZATION_NAME + FCLT_ORGANIZATION_KEY, HAVING COUNT(FCLT_ROOM_KEY) > 5) and dw_1833 (same tables, HAVING COUNT(*) > 5). Zero precedents on FAC_ROOMS or SPACE_DETAIL for this shape.\n\n### 4. Business Usage\nFCLT_ROOMS is consumed by 16 metrics for room-area statistics (avg/variance/stddev/range) joined to FCLT_ORGANIZATION for organization attribution. FCLT_ORGANIZATION is the parent dimension for both SPACE_UNIT and FCLT_ROOMS occupancy. FAC_* family is used only when FAC keys 